    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>📌 </span><strong><span>一句话总结：</span></strong><span>科学探索幸福的真相，更智慧地拥抱幸福，而不是被“幸福”绑架～</span><br><span>✨ </span><strong><span>本期关键词：</span></strong><span>幸福、幸福的误区、幸福的实践</span><br><span>🎯 </span><strong><span>你将收获：</span></strong><span>了解幸福的科学定义，如何花钱更幸福，幸福的局限性！</span></p><span></span><p><span>⌛ </span><strong><span>时间线</span></strong></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">01:05</a> 如何科学地研究幸福？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="832">13:52</a> 越有钱会越幸福吗？怎么花钱会更幸福？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1176">19:36</a> 幸福是不是越多越好？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 碎碎念</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><em><span>💖 如果本期播客对你有帮助，欢迎点赞、评论、收藏或转发～你的每一点小行动，都是我继续创作的动力✨</span></em></p><span></span><h3><span>✨</span><strong><span> 本期作业 | 与人连接</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><span>连续 7 天，每天至少与一个人深度连接15分钟。（也可以参考图片里的"微连接"来实践哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>对象可以是你很久未联系的朋友，也可以是身边的亲人、伴侣、室友，甚至陌生人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>💡 重点是：全身心投入，不看手机、不分心，只专注在这段真实的对话中。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fuxcr-gPSdFVGuoyqi3X-kg3kIXc.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>📝 本期资料</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>课程笔记：</span><a href="https://www.yuque.com/u32111634/bne1dm/efclhpy3nlcvfpcs" data-url="https://www.yuque.com/u32111634/bne1dm/efclhpy3nlcvfpcs"><span>清华积极心理学第二课</span></a></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>📮 联系阿拉</span></strong></h2><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>微信公众号｜阿拉的日常</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>邮箱｜alawei0325@qq.com</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>听友群｜公众号「阿拉的日常」后台回复「听友群」即可加入我们一起实践～</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><h3><strong><span>🎶背景音乐</span></strong></h3><span></span><p><a href="https://music.163.com/playlist?id=9344521987&amp;uct2=U2FsdGVkX18qqzhevvqabXlF2t6oIEYMosYFY2dSJ80=" data-url="ht